<Data>Data Flow Analysis : DFTx&#x000D;&#x000A;8/15/2016..5:37 PM&#x000D;&#x000A;Ambient Temperature[C]=27.000000&#x000D;&#x000A;CustomFIR_M &apos;DFTxSch.Subnetwork1__RFAmp\RFAmpHO_CustomFIR&apos;: Number of taps = 42.&#x000D;&#x000A;Maximum magnitude error = 3.9567128437551702e-001 dB (specified tolerance was 5.0e-001 dB) at frequency 2.548828125e+006Hz (computed with resolution bandwidth 9.765625e+003 Hz).&#x000D;&#x000A;Maximum phase error = 2.2177748996170219e+001 degrees at frequency 9.95e+008 Hz.&#x000D;&#x000A; This model  has been automatically inserted during RF_Link_PhasedArray analysis.  It is connected to &apos;Subnetwork1&apos;.&#x000D;&#x000A;CustomFIR_M &apos;DFTxSch.Subnetwork1__RFAmp\RFAmpHO_CustomFIR&apos;: Delay added to signal = 1.7e-006 sec.&#x000D;&#x000A; This model  has been automatically inserted during RF_Link_PhasedArray analysis.  It is connected to &apos;Subnetwork1&apos;.&#x000D;&#x000A;CustomFIR_M &apos;DFTxSch.Subnetwork1__BP_CustomFIR&apos;: Number of taps = 166.&#x000D;&#x000A;Maximum magnitude error = 4.18451567575572e-001 dB (specified tolerance was 5.0e-001 dB) at frequency 2.548828125e+006Hz (computed with resolution bandwidth 9.765625e+003 Hz).&#x000D;&#x000A;Maximum phase error = 7.3508585817588283e+001 degrees at frequency 9.95e+008 Hz.&#x000D;&#x000A; This model  has been automatically inserted during RF_Link_PhasedArray analysis.  It is connected to &apos;Subnetwork1&apos;.&#x000D;&#x000A;CustomFIR_M &apos;DFTxSch.Subnetwork1__BP_CustomFIR&apos;: Delay added to signal = 5.3000000000000001e-006 sec.&#x000D;&#x000A; This model  has been automatically inserted during RF_Link_PhasedArray analysis.  It is connected to &apos;Subnetwork1&apos;.&#x000D;&#x000A;Execution time: 5.731 sec&#x000D;&#x000A;</Data></Item>
